<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43863" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐετηρία</span></b> , ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔτος</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>a good season</i> (for the fruits of the earth), <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				5.2.4
			</span></i>, etc.: in pl., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν ταῖς
			εὐ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>GA</u>
				760b3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>thriving</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Smp.</u>
				188a
			</span></i>; of cattle, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				574a14
			</span></i>, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			generally, <i>prosperity, plenty</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ
				ἐκτὸς εὐ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>EN</u>
				1098b26
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				1155a8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Pol.</u>
				1306b11
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				799.16
			</span></i> (Cyzicus, <span class="entity">i A. D.</span>), etc.: personified, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Εὐ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12(2).262
			</span></i> (Mytil.), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ath.Mitt.</u>
				37.288
			</span></i> (Pergam., <span class="entity">ii A. D.</span>), etc.; as name of a
			trireme, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				22.1607.6
			</span></i>.</div>
